      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARA'S JACKSON (1) goes very well this course and distance starting 16 times for seven wins and six minors. Missed the frame latest (22.19) when fifth over 390m at this track in a Grade 5. Looks a key chance on best form. ZIPPING KRAVITZ (3) turned in a fair 5th placed finish last time at Capalaba over 366m (19.94). Has a good winning strike rate at this journey. Has a strong record from box 3, including two wins. Deserves plenty of respect. INDIAN RUPEE (2) settled close to the lead but checked in the run and turned spotting a start, missing the frame when eighth (23.04) at this track over 390m in a Grade 3/4. Rates a key player and gets chance to atone. MAGIC SHAZAM (7) placed two back in a Grade 4 at this track then backed that up with a second (21.84) over 390m at this track last time.",
